  m_text: "Log 19, [redacted]: \r\nC: Imma look around some more, mate..\r\nC: Surely
    I can leave him for a second..\r\nC: Yeah, what could happen in a minute?\r\nLog
    20, [redacted]:\r\nmuffled screaming mixed with steel screeching against steel\r\nC:
    That cannot be my mind, mate..\r\nC: Antony?\r\nC: \u2026\r\nC: He bleeding!\r\nmuffled
    screaming drawing closer\r\nC: I.. what the hell do I do?!\r\nC: Boss?\r\nLog
    21, [redacted]:\r\nrapid footsteps and heavy breathing\r\nC: The fuck is that?!\r\nC:
    Boss?!\r\nC: Please! He can\u2019t die on me! \r\nLog 22, [redacted]:\r\nradio
    static"
