  m_text: "Log 1, 12:28pm: \r\nA: First day, super excited! It\u2019s my and C[redact\u2019s
    first time going out to a location!\r\nLog 2, 13:09pm: \r\nC: Arrived at the
    aquarium, it looks even more cursed than I\u2019ve expected.\r\nA: There\u2019s
    glass everywhere, and is that blood? Hmm, probably not.\r\nLog 3, 14:09pm: \r\nA:
    Hourly check-up, nothing unusual to report\r\nLog 4, 14:46pm: \r\nC: God these
    halls man.. this looks so cursed.."
