    6, 16:54pm: \r\nC: Did you hear that? Dude I\u2019m hearing things..\r\nLog 7,
    16:56pm:\r\nC: Is that.. screaming?\r\nLog 8 [redacted]\r\n[redacted]\r\nLog
    9, 20:39pm: \r\nA: I\u2019m calling it a night, you wanna be on watch first?\r\nC:
    Sure mate, I don\u2019t think I can sleep after hearing that shit..\r\nA: You\u2019re
    insane, dude, there was no noise, just your mind playing tricks on ya\r\nC: I
    hope so.."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
